  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Failure**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the root cause of the build failure within `src/main.tsx`. The unresolved import statement, specifically `./styles/float-ide-design.css`, is causing Vite to throw an error immediately during the build process. Further investigation is needed to determine the expected location and contents of the missing CSS file.\n\n\n**Investigating Linter Errors**\n\nI\'m now diving into the TypeScript linter errors. Running `tsc --noEmit` yielded several issues. I am seeing that, in `scripts/testOpenAIIntegration.ts`, `startsWith` is failing on a `never` type, which needs to be addressed. Moreover, in `src/server/agent/subagents.ts`, I see missing properties for `IndexStats` (`fileCount`, `symbolCount`), and a missing property (`warningCount`) in an object in the same file. I also noticed that  `src/server/app.ts` is experiencing a missing `error` property.\n\n\n"
