  planner_response {
    response: "### 1. Root Cause Diagnosis & Exact Files Responsible\n\nInspection of the build and compiler diagnostics revealed the following root causes:\n\n1. **Vite Production Build Failure (Primary blocker preventing `npm run build`)**:\n   - **File**: `src/main.tsx` (Line 6)\n   - **Diagnostic**: `Could not resolve \"./styles/float-ide-design.css\" from \"src/main.tsx\"`\n   - **Root Cause**: An extraneous import `import \'./styles/float-ide-design.css\';` was referencing a non-existent file path. The project\'s unified styling system is contained entirely in `src/index.css` via Tailwind CSS v4.\n\n2. **TypeScript Compiler Diagnostics (`tsc --noEmit` / `npm run lint`)**:\n   - **`src/server/app.ts` (Line 150)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `error TS2339: Property \'error\' does not exist on type \'{ ok: true; config: UserCloudSessionConfig; } | { ok: false; error: string; }\'`.\n     - Root Cause: TypeScript failed to narrow the discriminated union of `updateRes` inside the session connect endpoint.\n   - **`src/server/skills/skillsService.ts` (Lines 24, 29, 43, 58, 73, 88, 103, 118)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `error TS2322: Types of property \'permissionsRequired\' are incompatible. Type \'string[]\' is not assignable to type \'(\"read\" | \"write\" | \"git\" | \"network\")[]\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Object literals in `Object.freeze` inferred `[\'read\']` as wide `string[]` instead of literal union array members.\n   - **`src/server/agent/subagents.ts` (Lines 170, 192)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `Property \'fileCount\' does not exist on type \'IndexStats\'` and `Property \'warningCount\' does not exist on type \'{ criticalCount, highCount, mediumCount, lowCount, total }\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Property mismatch against `IndexStats` (which defines `totalFiles` and `totalSymbols`) and `ReviewReport[\'summary\']` (which defines `highCount` and `mediumCount`).\n   - **`scripts/testOpenAIIntegration.ts` (Line 243)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `Property \'startsWith\' does not exist on type \'never\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Branch narrowing on constant string literal `\'gpt-6-astra\'` caused the fallback check to narrow `modelId` to `never`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Changes Made\n\nOnly the confirmed root causes were repaired without altering any existing UI, routes, store architecture, authentication, or functionality:\n\n- **`src/main.tsx`**:\n  - Removed the broken import `import \'./styles/float-ide-design.css\';`. All Tailwind styles and design tokens remain loaded via `import \'./index.css\';`.\n- **`src/server/app.ts`**:\n  - Explicitly typed the error branch for `updateRes` to ensure safe, type-checked response handling: `(updateRes as { ok: false; error: string }).error`.\n- **`src/server/skills/skillsService.ts`**:\n  - Defined `export type FloatSkillPermission = \'read\' | \'write\' | \'network\' | \'git\';` and annotated `permissionsRequired` with `FloatSkillPermission[]` across all `BUILT_IN_SKILLS`.\n- **`src/server/agent/subagents.ts`**:\n  - Replaced `stats.fileCount` and `stats.symbolCount` with `stats.totalFiles` and `stats.totalSymbols`.\n  - Replaced `latestReview.summary.warningCount` with `latestReview.summary.highCount + latestReview.summary.mediumCount`.\n- **`scripts/testOpenAIIntegration.ts`**:\n  - Simplified the assertion to `assert(GPT6_ASTRA_CLOUD_CONFIG.modelId === \'gpt-6-astra\', ...)` avoiding incorrect narrowing to `never`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification & Results\n\n1. **Applet Compilation (`npm run build`)**:\n   - Command: `compile_applet` (`vite build && esbuild src/server/app.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=cjs --packages=external --sourcemap --outfile=dist/server.cjs`)\n   - **Result**: `Build succeeded - the applet is compiled` (0 errors).\n\n2. **TypeScript & Linter Diagnostics (`npm run lint`)**:\n   - Command: `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`)\n   - **Result**: `Linting completed successfully` (0 errors, exit code 0).\n\n3. **Regression Test Suite (`npm test`)**:\n   - Ran all 45+ test files covering security regression, audit checks, agent loop, navigation, and website experience enhancements.\n   - **Result**: All suites passed successfully.\n\n4. **Dev Server**:\n   - Restarted cleanly on port 3000.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Remaining Errors\n\n- **Remaining build errors**: 0\n- **Remaining lint/type errors**: 0\n\n### 5. Deployment Status\n\n- Local build and validation checks have passed. Deployment to production was not performed."
    modified_response: "### 1. Root Cause Diagnosis & Exact Files Responsible\n\nInspection of the build and compiler diagnostics revealed the following root causes:\n\n1. **Vite Production Build Failure (Primary blocker preventing `npm run build`)**:\n   - **File**: `src/main.tsx` (Line 6)\n   - **Diagnostic**: `Could not resolve \"./styles/float-ide-design.css\" from \"src/main.tsx\"`\n   - **Root Cause**: An extraneous import `import \'./styles/float-ide-design.css\';` was referencing a non-existent file path. The project\'s unified styling system is contained entirely in `src/index.css` via Tailwind CSS v4.\n\n2. **TypeScript Compiler Diagnostics (`tsc --noEmit` / `npm run lint`)**:\n   - **`src/server/app.ts` (Line 150)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `error TS2339: Property \'error\' does not exist on type \'{ ok: true; config: UserCloudSessionConfig; } | { ok: false; error: string; }\'`.\n     - Root Cause: TypeScript failed to narrow the discriminated union of `updateRes` inside the session connect endpoint.\n   - **`src/server/skills/skillsService.ts` (Lines 24, 29, 43, 58, 73, 88, 103, 118)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `error TS2322: Types of property \'permissionsRequired\' are incompatible. Type \'string[]\' is not assignable to type \'(\"read\" | \"write\" | \"git\" | \"network\")[]\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Object literals in `Object.freeze` inferred `[\'read\']` as wide `string[]` instead of literal union array members.\n   - **`src/server/agent/subagents.ts` (Lines 170, 192)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `Property \'fileCount\' does not exist on type \'IndexStats\'` and `Property \'warningCount\' does not exist on type \'{ criticalCount, highCount, mediumCount, lowCount, total }\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Property mismatch against `IndexStats` (which defines `totalFiles` and `totalSymbols`) and `ReviewReport[\'summary\']` (which defines `highCount` and `mediumCount`).\n   - **`scripts/testOpenAIIntegration.ts` (Line 243)**:\n     - Diagnostic: `Property \'startsWith\' does not exist on type \'never\'`.\n     - Root Cause: Branch narrowing on constant string literal `\'gpt-6-astra\'` caused the fallback check to narrow `modelId` to `never`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Changes Made\n\nOnly the confirmed root causes were repaired without altering any existing UI, routes, store architecture, authentication, or functionality:\n\n- **`src/main.tsx`**:\n  - Removed the broken import `import \'./styles/float-ide-design.css\';`. All Tailwind styles and design tokens remain loaded via `import \'./index.css\';`.\n- **`src/server/app.ts`**:\n  - Explicitly typed the error branch for `updateRes` to ensure safe, type-checked response handling: `(updateRes as { ok: false; error: string }).error`.\n- **`src/server/skills/skillsService.ts`**:\n  - Defined `export type FloatSkillPermission = \'read\' | \'write\' | \'network\' | \'git\';` and annotated `permissionsRequired` with `FloatSkillPermission[]` across all `BUILT_IN_SKILLS`.\n- **`src/server/agent/subagents.ts`**:\n  - Replaced `stats.fileCount` and `stats.symbolCount` with `stats.totalFiles` and `stats.totalSymbols`.\n  - Replaced `latestReview.summary.warningCount` with `latestReview.summary.highCount + latestReview.summary.mediumCount`.\n- **`scripts/testOpenAIIntegration.ts`**:\n  - Simplified the assertion to `assert(GPT6_ASTRA_CLOUD_CONFIG.modelId === \'gpt-6-astra\', ...)` avoiding incorrect narrowing to `never`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification & Results\n\n1. **Applet Compilation (`npm run build`)**:\n   - Command: `compile_applet` (`vite build && esbuild src/server/app.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=cjs --packages=external --sourcemap --outfile=dist/server.cjs`)\n   - **Result**: `Build succeeded - the applet is compiled` (0 errors).\n\n2. **TypeScript & Linter Diagnostics (`npm run lint`)**:\n   - Command: `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`)\n   - **Result**: `Linting completed successfully` (0 errors, exit code 0).\n\n3. **Regression Test Suite (`npm test`)**:\n   - Ran all 45+ test files covering security regression, audit checks, agent loop, navigation, and website experience enhancements.\n   - **Result**: All suites passed successfully.\n\n4. **Dev Server**:\n   - Restarted cleanly on port 3000.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Remaining Errors\n\n- **Remaining build errors**: 0\n- **Remaining lint/type errors**: 0\n\n### 5. Deployment Status\n\n- Local build and validation checks have passed. Deployment to production was not performed."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
